<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MBNA started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MBNA started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of MBNA Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $40 a share.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;MBNA is the bellwether monoline credit card issuer and one of the elite players in the rapidly evolving credit card industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- MBNA was unchanged at 33.</p>
</text>
